  "details": "Description\n\nWhen using flick select off im unable to use the right action wheel without having the left wheel open so i can use my left trigger in vr, all inputs get ignored and i have to use only my left action wheel most of the time\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nTurn of flick select while in vr and open a action wheel on your right hand, also test with both wheels open so you can use the left trigger with the right wheel.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p2-1921-15c4a824b2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-17_13-15-03.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_e46672c6-b131-4934-b43c-7f8cb9f2b744/1/file)",
